    "capture": "Public shipping fetch_xmltv and background_refresh; no algorithm copies, replacement adapters, mock source loading or external network. Local temporary files and isolated SQLite only.",
    "timestampNormalization": "Exact wall-clock seconds are nondeterministic; expected records assert positive fetched_at bounded by seconds immediately before and after each call/first tick. Background seed uses fetched_at=17 and waits for replacement, with a five-second timeout.",
